{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49105","headline":"阮郎归 · 後主煜","name":"阮郎归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风吹水日衔山，春来长是闲。\n落花狼藉酒阑珊，笙歌醉梦间。\n春睡觉，晚妆残，无人整翠鬟。\n留连光景惜朱颜，黄昏独倚阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}